# Agent workflows

- New feature: admin UI first; update specs + changelog; do not guess items in MASTER_PLAN section 10.
- Deploy: ZIP to domain root (`scripts/pack.ps1`). Local verify: `php -S localhost:8080 router.php`.
- Incident: fail closed, keep unpublished posts private, preserve audit_log. Do not delete the SQLite file unless the operator asks.
